  "Decision": "Adopt exact fixed-point wall vertical sampling for opaque bands and masked textures, with lazy visible-band preparation. Keep analytic geometry/coverage, pegging, depth/order, non-power-of-two wrapping and the three display modes. No compiled production helper. Accumulator, wrapping-mask, exact-binary and eager/lazy preparations retained as bounded alternatives.",
  "ArithmeticMeaning": "Scale is quantized/clamped to16.16; inverse uintMax/scale floors and texture anchor truncates to16.16. Evaluating origin+(y-84)*step in binary double is exact for these integer fractions of1/65536: signed fixed map/view/offset values and screen-row delta times valid inverse scale stay far below2^53. It equals the checked accumulator without accumulated roundoff. This does not fix the analytic geometry/angle scale differences from the reference.",
  "Limits": "28,119,040 authored texel/depth samples across four heights qualify scalar sampling/finite row holes within candidate-defined coverage; not original masked-post edges or arbitrary BSP projection.960,000 pixels and depths repeat the first correct trial at fifteen views; actual all-style workers match960,000 pixels/240strips with their own serial reference.36-map idle smoke is not campaign completion. Static image comparisons improve overall in E1M2 but worsen one E1M2 view by1 and one E3M6 view by96; full original/moving image fidelity remains open. All nine serial ABBA datasets retain cold calls/outliers and compare baseline to each trial within one process. Final lazy later dense cycles remain about4\u20136% slower although whole-run means are lower owing to initial-call asymmetry; no causal native gain/60FPS claim. Full campaign/pacing/physical/acoustic/DPI/hardware qualification remains open.",
  "FailureMeaning": "First static launch rejected comma-string Angles before running; correct explicit array retained separately. First cost harness failed resolving the module-private sector-cache helper with zero timed calls; snapshot setup now runs inside each renderer module. Masked fixture initially expected a tall backdrop but authored a short wall; all153600 mismatches belonged to masked cases. Its source/report are retained, then the backdrop sector is corrected before baseline and production comparison; no expected product pixels rewritten."
}
